{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3015015010010","name":"甜花","text":"──『収録終わった』……","trans":"──“收录结束了”……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010020","name":"甜花","text":"……『レッスン\r\n今から向かう』──","trans":"……“练习\n现在过去”──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010040","name":"甜花","text":"なーちゃんだ……","trans":"是甘奈……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010050","name":"甜花","text":"返信、早い……","trans":"回得，好快……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010060","name":"甘奈","text":"『お疲れ様！\r\n待ってるよ！』","trans":"“辛苦了！\n等着你哦！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010070","name":"甜花","text":"やったね……！","trans":"太好了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010090","name":"甜花","text":"（甜花の出てる……\r\n番組の、スクショ……？）","trans":"（甜花出演的……\n节目的，截图……？）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010100","name":"甜花","text":"『すごい』","trans":"“好厉害”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010110","name":"甜花","text":"『甜花のスクショ』","trans":"“甜花的截图”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010120","name":"甜花","text":"『番組のやつ』","trans":"“节目的那个”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010140","name":"甘奈","text":"『甜花ちゃん、めっちゃおもしろいこと\r\nいっぱい言ってるし、保存してるんだ！』","trans":"“甜花，说了好多有趣的话\n我都保存下来了呢！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010150","name":"甜花","text":"『初耳』","trans":"“第一次听说”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010160","name":"甜花","text":"美味しいでしかない","trans":"除了好吃没别的了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010170","name":"甜花","text":"『何これ』","trans":"“这是什么”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010180","name":"甘奈","text":"『これはね～』","trans":"“这个是呢～”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010190","name":"甘奈","text":"『甜花ちゃんがクイズに正解して、\r\nご褒美スイーツをゲットした時の！』","trans":"“甜花答对了题目，\n拿到奖励甜点的时候的！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010200","name":"甜花","text":"『全然記憶にない。。。』","trans":"“完全没有记忆。。。”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010210","name":"甜花","text":"えっ","trans":"诶","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010230","name":"甜花","text":"『画像で会話できてる。。』","trans":"“竟然用图片对话起来了。。”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010250","name":"千雪","text":"『私も今向かってます』","trans":"“我也正过去”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010260","name":"甜花","text":"あ……\r\n千雪さん……！","trans":"啊……\n千雪……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010270","name":"甜花","text":"これでもそれなりに急いでる","trans":"这已经算是相当赶了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010290","name":"甜花","text":"『千雪さんまで』","trans":"“连千雪也”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010300","name":"千雪","text":"『私も、甘奈ちゃんと同じなの』","trans":"“我也和甘奈一样”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010310","name":"千雪","text":"『甜花ちゃん、おもしろくってつい』","trans":"“甜花太有趣了，忍不住”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010320","name":"甜花","text":"『でもこれは覚えてる』","trans":"“不过这个我记得”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010330","name":"甜花","text":"『食パン早食いチャレンジの時』","trans":"“吐司快吃挑战的时候”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010340","name":"千雪","text":"『正解♪』","trans":"“答对了♪”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010350","name":"甘奈","text":"『あの回、めっちゃ楽しかった！』","trans":"“那期，超开心的！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010360","name":"甘奈","text":"『甜花ちゃん、頑張ってたよね～』","trans":"“甜花，很努力呢～”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010370","name":"甜花","text":"『早食いチャレンジ、ビリだったけど』","trans":"“快吃挑战，虽然我是最后一名”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010380","name":"千雪","text":"『こんな名言が出たんだもん\r\nそれで充分』","trans":"“都出了这样的名言\n那就够了”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010390","name":"甘奈","text":"『うんうん！』","trans":"“嗯嗯！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010400","name":"甜花","text":"それはそう","trans":"确实！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010410","name":"甜花","text":"──あ……\r\n『それはそう』……","trans":"──啊……\n“说得也是”……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010420","name":"甜花","text":"（……こんなのも……\r\nあるんだ……）","trans":"（……这种事……\n也有啊……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010440","name":"甜花","text":"（──なーちゃんも、千雪さんも……）","trans":"（──甘奈也，千雪也……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010450","name":"甜花","text":"（甜花の、番組……\r\nすっごく……見てくれてる……）","trans":"（甜花的，节目……\n看得好认真……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010470","name":"甜花","text":"（また……\r\nスクショ、保存してもらえるように……）","trans":"（希望……\n又能被截图保存下来……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010480","name":"甜花","text":"（甜花、頑張るね……！）","trans":"（甜花，会努力的……！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010490","name":"甜花","text":"（──あ、その前に……）","trans":"（──啊，在那之前……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010500","name":"甜花","text":"（レッスン、急がなきゃ……！）","trans":"（练习，得赶快去……！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3015015010510","name":"甜花","text":"（それなりに……！！）","trans":"（相当赶地……！！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}